 "notes": "Shore dive at the old unloading quay (loswal) at Dreischor: entry beside the swimmers' steiger, a long shallow flat at about 2 m with oyster beds and weed, old dike stones left and right of the steiger, and the fairway beyond. The bottom drops to 15 m and rises again to 8 m further out, at an unknown distance, so no contours are drawn; the shore, the buoys and the second tagged entry are from OpenStreetMap. Positions are approximate and the map is sparse.",
